      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow6:093",
        "answer": "Args are current item,list,controller,target state. Get current item arrowState model and return without value if absent. Set up=false/down=false/before=true. Iterate list:forEachElement(); flip before=false before testing the current item state, then for each target-state item set up when before or down otherwise. Therefore a matching current item counts in down. Select NONE, BOTH if both, UP if up only, DOWN if down only, and set arrowState. Keep nonlocal-looking f8_local4 assignment and no loop cancellation/reset.",
